From b968bcc0a0564ba988d2ef90fd80b90ea443ce6a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 08:24:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 6/7] kpi: file objects, kqueue, vmem, sbt sleep and cdevpriv

file.rs: struct file-backed objects (install, FileRef with type check,
default fileops, fo_close frees the Box). event.rs: selinfo/knlist on an
existing mutex and knote helpers. vmem.rs: vmem arenas. mtx.rs:
msleep_sbt returning the raw errno (ERESTART), sbinuptime. cdev.rs:
devfs_set_cdevpriv/devfs_get_cdevpriv for a boxed per-open state.
usercopy.rs: raw copy_in/copy_out for #[repr(C)] structs.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
